## 🚀 Exploitation / Solution Path
Detail your step-by-step breakdown to get the flag:
1. Download the 3 files related to the challenge "here","flag"and"hash" using wget  or manual download.
2. Open the level4 file using "nano".
3. Change the "pos_pw_list" variable to global scope or place it above the level_4_pw_check function.
4. Add a comment to the user input line in the same function and add for loop below comment line and arrange below code in indentation except "incorrect password".
5. Save it with ctrl+o,enter and ctrl+x.
6. Again run the level4.py and it will generate the flag automatically. 



